---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Keys">
  <h1>Recipient keys</h1>
  <p>
    The sender will accept one RSA-3072 or RSA-4096 SPKI PUBLIC KEY PEM with
    exponent 65537. Verify its full SHA-256 fingerprint through a trusted
    channel.
  </p>
  <p>
    Never paste private keys or passphrases into the website. Encrypted private
    keys belong only in the separately verified offline receiver. Key setup
    instructions and receiver readiness checks are pending.
  </p>
  <p>For portable Windows key setup, choose a long random passphrase using ASCII characters. Non-ASCII bytes can differ between OpenSSL's interactive console and the receiver; that interactive compatibility has not yet been tested. UTF-8 synthetic file fixtures passing does not establish console compatibility.</p>
</Layout>
